{
  "info": {
    "name": "Q01 · ArrayList vs LinkedList",
    "description": "Colección de Postman para el punto 1 del examen.\n\nEl context-path de la aplicación es /api/q1, así que todas las URLs cuelgan de él.\n\nOrden de uso: ejecuta primero «01 · Crear lista». Su script de respuesta guarda el `id` en la variable de entorno `listId`, y el resto de peticiones la usan ya montada.\n\nVariables: `baseUrl` (http://localhost:8080/api/q1), `listId` y `type`.",
    "_postman_id": "b8f3c1a2-7d64-4e19-9c05-q1a1b2c3d4e5",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api/q1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Suite de verificación (52 comprobaciones)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/verify",
        "description": "Ejecuta la batería completa de comprobaciones del contrato de List contra las dos implementaciones y devuelve el informe."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const informe = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log(`Comprobaciones: ${informe.total} | superadas: ${informe.passed} | fallidas: ${informe.failed}`);",
              "pm.test('todas las comprobaciones se superan', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(informe.failed).to.eql(0);",
              "    pm.expect(informe.passed).to.eql(informe.total);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Crear lista",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/arraylist",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"values\": [1, \"a\", null]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Crea una MyArrayList con contenido inicial. El script guarda el id en la variable de entorno listId."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('se crea con 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "const creada = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('listId', creada.id);",
              "pm.environment.set('type', creada.type);",
              "console.log('listId = ' + creada.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Ver la lista",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Añadir elemento al final",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/elements",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"value\": \"nuevo\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Añade al final. El body debe ser un objeto JSON con la clave \"value\"."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('se añade con 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "pm.test('el tamaño crece en 1', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().size).to.eql(2);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 · Añadir elemento en una posición",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/elements/0",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"value\": \"primero\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Inserta en la posición 0 y desplaza el resto. Los índices empiezan en cero."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 · Reemplazar elemento",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/elements/1",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"value\": \"cambiado\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "06 · Leer un elemento",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/elements/1"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "07 · Borrar por posición",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/elements/0"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "08 · Buscar (index-of)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/index-of",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"value\": \"a\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Es POST y no GET porque el valor viaja en el body JSON: así el tipo lo decide Jackson y la comparación es exacta. Mandar 1 (número) no es lo mismo que \"1\" (cadena)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "09 · Comprobar (contains)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}/contains",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"value\": \"a\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10 · Listar todas las listas",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11 · Listar filtrado por tipo",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists?type=array_list",
        "description": "El filtro acepta arraylist, array-list, array_list, linkedlist, linked-list… sin distinguir mayúsculas. Un valor vacío no filtra; uno inválido da 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "12 · Borrar la lista",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lists/{{type}}/{{listId}}"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('se borra con 204', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });",
              "pm.environment.unset('listId');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
